{"seq":3,"slug":"asset-publish-channel-distribute","title":"审批后多渠道分发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-creative-dam-aigc-production/creative-approval-flow/asset-publish-channel-distribute","wordCount":2816,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"审批后多渠道分发\">审批后多渠道分发</h1><p>审批通过只是拿到了通行证，把素材真正送达每个渠道还有一段容易出错的工程：每个渠道有自己的素材规格、上传接口、审核队列与拒绝理由，而拒绝通常发生在投放开始之后。分发环节的设计目标因此不是&quot;尽快推上去&quot;，而是&quot;推上去的每一个素材都能被证明是已批准的那一个，且失败可重试、重试不重复、撤回能追平&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-分发记录与投放绑定\">核心概念：分发记录与投放绑定</h2><p>分发的原子单位是（素材版本，市场，渠道位置，投放计划）四元组。少任何一个都会产生歧义：同一个版本投两个渠道是两条分发记录，同一个渠道投两次不同的活动也是两条。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  AP[&quot;审批通过&lt;br/&gt;approval_instance approved&quot;] --&gt; BIND[&quot;绑定投放计划&quot;]&#10;  BIND --&gt; S1[&quot;规格适配&lt;br/&gt;尺寸/格式/时长&quot;]&#10;  S1 --&gt; UP[&quot;渠道上传&lt;br/&gt;幂等 external_id&quot;]&#10;  UP --&gt; V1{&quot;渠道审核&quot;}&#10;  V1 --&gt;|通过| LIVE[&quot;已投放&lt;br/&gt;记录 external_ref&quot;]&#10;  V1 --&gt;|拒绝| REJ[&quot;采集拒绝理由&quot;]&#10;  REJ --&gt; FIX[&quot;修正 / 重生成&quot;]&#10;  FIX --&gt; UP&#10;  LIVE --&gt; WD[&quot;撤回&lt;br/&gt;版本变更或规则失效&quot;]&#10;  WD --&gt; UPD[&quot;渠道下架 + 记录状态&quot;]\">graph TD\n  AP[\"审批通过&lt;br/&gt;approval_instance approved\"] --&gt; BIND[\"绑定投放计划\"]\n  BIND --&gt; S1[\"规格适配&lt;br/&gt;尺寸/格式/时长\"]\n  S1 --&gt; UP[\"渠道上传&lt;br/&gt;幂等 external_id\"]\n  UP --&gt; V1{\"渠道审核\"}\n  V1 --&gt;|通过| LIVE[\"已投放&lt;br/&gt;记录 external_ref\"]\n  V1 --&gt;|拒绝| REJ[\"采集拒绝理由\"]\n  REJ --&gt; FIX[\"修正 / 重生成\"]\n  FIX --&gt; UP\n  LIVE --&gt; WD[\"撤回&lt;br/&gt;版本变更或规则失效\"]\n  WD --&gt; UPD[\"渠道下架 + 记录状态\"]</pre><p>关键在于 <code>external_id</code> 与 <code>external_ref</code> 的区分：<code>external_id</code> 是本地生成、上传前就确定的幂等键，用于避免重复上传；<code>external_ref</code> 是渠道返回的真实素材标识，用于后续的撤回与效果拉取。两者都必须记录，只有前者无法撤回，只有后者无法幂等重试。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE distribution (&#10;  distribution_id bigserial PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  version_id      bigint NOT NULL REFERENCES asset_version(version_id),&#10;  instance_id     bigint NOT NULL REFERENCES approval_instance(instance_id),&#10;  market          text NOT NULL,&#10;  channel         text NOT NULL,&#10;  placement       text NOT NULL,&#10;  campaign_ref    text NOT NULL,&#10;  external_id     text NOT NULL,&#10;  external_ref    text,&#10;  status          text NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;pending&#39;&#10;                    CHECK (status IN (&#39;pending&#39;,&#39;uploaded&#39;,&#39;in_review&#39;,&#39;live&#39;,&#10;                                      &#39;rejected&#39;,&#39;withdrawn&#39;,&#39;failed&#39;)),&#10;  reject_code     text,&#10;  reject_detail   text,&#10;  content_digest  text NOT NULL,&#10;  uploaded_at     timestamptz,&#10;  live_at         timestamptz,&#10;  withdrawn_at    timestamptz,&#10;  UNIQUE (external_id),&#10;  UNIQUE (version_id, channel, placement, campaign_ref)&#10;);&#10;CREATE INDEX distribution_live ON distribution (status, live_at)&#10;  WHERE status IN (&#39;uploaded&#39;,&#39;in_review&#39;,&#39;live&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> distribution</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  distribution_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigserial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  version_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asset_version(version_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  instance_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> approval_instance(instance_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  placement       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  campaign_ref    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  external_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  external_ref    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pending'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                    CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'uploaded'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'in_review'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'live'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                                      'rejected'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'withdrawn'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'failed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reject_code     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reject_detail   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  content_digest  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  uploaded_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  live_at         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  withdrawn_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (external_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (version_id, channel, placement, campaign_ref)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> distribution_live</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> distribution</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, live_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'uploaded'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'in_review'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'live'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>content_digest</code> 在这里的用途与审批里的语义指纹一致：分发时必须校验当前素材内容仍与审批时一致。若不一致，说明审批失效传播没做干净，分发应直接拒绝而不是上传。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规格适配-最后一次渲染机会\">规格适配：最后一次渲染机会</h2><p>上传前的规格适配与第 1 章的呈现件生成是同一件事，区别在于此时已经有了具体的渠道位置，规格约束最完整。此处必须处理渠道特有的三类要求：</p>\n<p><strong>文件级要求。</strong> 最大体积、允许的编码（图片的格式与色彩空间、视频的编解码与码率）、是否允许透明通道。视频侧要特别注意编码兼容性——不同渠道支持的编解码集合不同，转码参数选错会在部分用户设备上无法播放。行业里 AV1 作为开放免版税的编解码已有通用规范支撑其比特流格式与解码过程 <a href=\"https://aomediacodec.github.io/av1-spec/\">AV1 Bitstream &amp; Decoding Process Specification</a>，但实际支持度与分发渠道相关，不能默认全渠道可用。</p>\n<p><strong>文案字段级要求。</strong> 广告平台对文案有明确的字段与上限，且&quot;最少条数&quot;是硬性要求。以响应式搜索广告为例：标题上限 30 字符、描述上限 90 字符，标题至少 3 条最多 15 条，描述至少 2 条最多 4 条，双宽字符语言（中日韩）每个字符计 2 个字符 <a href=\"https://support.google.com/google-ads/answer/7684791\">Google Ads RSA specs</a>。&quot;最少 3 条标题&quot;意味着分发时如果本地生成的候选不足，上传会直接被拒——这类校验必须在本地做，而不是等渠道返回错误。</p>\n<p><strong>程序化投放的创意结构。</strong> 走 DSP 或程序化购买时，素材以结构化的创意对象参与竞价，字段命名与枚举值由行业规范定义。OpenRTB 定义了实时竞价的请求与响应结构，其 2.6 版本增加了 CTV 买卖、广告时段（ad pod）、结构化 User-Agent 对象等能力，并采用 AdCOM 的枚举列表以便更快更新取值 <a href=\"https://iabtechlab.com/standards/openrtb/\">IAB Tech Lab OpenRTB</a>。AdCOM 本身是一套共享的库存描述词汇，OpenRTB 负责拍卖与传输机制，AdCOM 提供枚举值使请求更小、描述更精确 <a href=\"https://iabtechlab.com/standards/adcom/\">IAB Tech Lab AdCOM</a>。工程含义是：创意在进入程序化渠道前必须能映射成规范的创意对象，而这个映射关系应当是配置而非硬编码。</p>\n<h3 id=\"规格矩阵的维护\">规格矩阵的维护</h3><p>规格是外部事实，会变。把它维护成配置表并带生效期，与 <a href=\"../creative-dam-model/market-channel-asset-reuse\">按市场×渠道的素材复用</a> 的市场渲染规则同构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;channel&quot;: &quot;google-ads&quot;,&#10;  &quot;placement&quot;: &quot;rsa-text&quot;,&#10;  &quot;effectiveFrom&quot;: &quot;2026-01-01&quot;,&#10;  &quot;textFields&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;headline&quot;, &quot;min&quot;: 3, &quot;max&quot;: 15, &quot;maxChars&quot;: 30, &quot;doubleWidthCounts&quot;: true },&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;description&quot;, &quot;min&quot;: 2, &quot;max&quot;: 4, &quot;maxChars&quot;: 90, &quot;doubleWidthCounts&quot;: true },&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;path&quot;, &quot;min&quot;: 0, &quot;max&quot;: 2, &quot;maxChars&quot;: 15, &quot;doubleWidthCounts&quot;: true }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;assetFields&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;image&quot;, &quot;aspects&quot;: [&quot;1:1&quot;, &quot;1.91:1&quot;], &quot;minWidth&quot;: 1200, &quot;maxBytes&quot;: 5242880 },&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;logo&quot;, &quot;aspects&quot;: [&quot;1:1&quot;], &quot;minWidth&quot;: 128, &quot;maxBytes&quot;: 5242880 }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;videoAsset&quot;: { &quot;required&quot;: false, &quot;minDurationSec&quot;: 10, &quot;codecs&quot;: [&quot;h264&quot;, &quot;vp9&quot;] }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"channel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"google-ads\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"placement\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rsa-text\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"effectiveFrom\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-01-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"textFields\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"headline\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"maxChars\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"doubleWidthCounts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"maxChars\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"doubleWidthCounts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"maxChars\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"doubleWidthCounts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"assetFields\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"image\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"aspects\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1:1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.91:1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"minWidth\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"maxBytes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5242880</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"logo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"aspects\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1:1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"minWidth\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"maxBytes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5242880</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"videoAsset\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"required\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"minDurationSec\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"codecs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"h264\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"vp9\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>doubleWidthCounts</code> 这个字段是前面提到的中日韩计数的落地方式：字符校验函数按此开关决定是数字符还是数字节宽度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三类要求的校验顺序\">三类要求的校验顺序</h3><p>三类要求必须在本地按固定顺序校验，顺序错了会得到误导性的失败信息。正确顺序是文件级 → 文案字段级 → 创意结构映射：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>文件级</strong>先过。尺寸、体积、编码不符时后续校验没有意义——一个超体积的图片即使文案合规也传不上去。</li>\n<li><strong>文案字段级</strong>次之。这一级要在<strong>字符计数正确</strong>的前提下做，因此必须先确定该位置的 <code>doubleWidthCounts</code> 取值。计数错误会产生&quot;本地通过、渠道拒绝&quot;这类最难排查的失败。</li>\n<li><strong>创意结构映射</strong>最后。它依赖前两级的结果（只有合规的文件与文案才有资格组装成创意对象），且它的失败通常需要人工调整映射配置，不是重试能解决的。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>每级校验失败时记录的信息粒度不同：文件级记具体超标项与实测值；文案级记字段名、实际计数、上限，并注明计数模式；结构级记缺失或非法的字段名与规范依据的版本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"幂等上传与重试\">幂等上传与重试</h2><p>上传失败是常态：网络抖动、渠道限流、临时 5xx。重试的前提是幂等。用本地生成的 <code>external_id</code> 作为幂等键，渠道侧若有幂等接口就直接传，若没有则在本地做对账——重试前先查询该 <code>external_id</code> 是否已存在。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 上传前的对账：避免重试造成重复素材&#10;SELECT distribution_id, external_ref, status&#10;  FROM distribution&#10; WHERE external_id = :external_id&#10;   AND status IN (&#39;uploaded&#39;,&#39;in_review&#39;,&#39;live&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 上传前的对账：避免重试造成重复素材</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> distribution_id, external_ref, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> distribution</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> external_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :external_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'uploaded'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'in_review'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'live'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>若查询返回记录，说明上一次上传实际上成功了只是响应丢失，此时应当收下结果继续推进，而不是重新上传。这与 <a href=\"../aigc-creative-production/ai-copy-image-video-gen\">AI 文案/图/视频批量生成</a> 里&quot;超时不等于没发生&quot;是同一条原则——分发侧的上传同样是不可轻易重放的外部副作用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"渠道审核的异步性\">渠道审核的异步性</h3><p>上传成功不等于可投放。多数渠道有素材审核，审核结果异步返回，可能几小时也可能一天。这要求分发记录的状态机把 <code>uploaded</code>、<code>in_review</code>、<code>live</code>、<code>rejected</code> 分开，而不是上传成功就置为已投放。</p>\n<p>审核拒绝需要采集结构化的拒绝理由。渠道返回的理由通常是一段文本加一个错误码，采集时应当映射到本地的缺陷分类（与 <a href=\"../aigc-creative-production/human-review-brand-guard\">人工审校与品牌一致性</a> 的 <code>defect_class</code> 对齐），这样拒绝理由才能与生成模板、预检规则关联起来形成改进闭环。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>渠道拒绝码类别</th>\n<th>映射到本地缺陷类别</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>规格不符（尺寸/体积/时长）</td>\n<td><code>quality_low</code></td>\n<td>修规格配置或重渲染</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文案超限</td>\n<td><code>text_overflow</code></td>\n<td>缩短文案，检查字符计数开关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>素材政策（内容不适）</td>\n<td><code>cultural_issue</code></td>\n<td>提升本地化粒度，人工重审</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>宣称违规</td>\n<td><code>legal_claim</code></td>\n<td>回到审批环节，补规则或改宣称</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商标/版权</td>\n<td><code>legal_claim</code></td>\n<td>检查授权覆盖范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术错误（不可解码）</td>\n<td><code>quality_low</code></td>\n<td>重新转码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"撤回-比推送更难的一半\">撤回：比推送更难的一半</h2><p>素材撤回的触发条件有四类：素材版本被新版本取代、授权到期或被撤销、审批实例被作废、投放计划提前结束。四类都要能触发撤回，因此撤回逻辑不能散落在四个地方，而应统一由一个&quot;可投放性&quot;判定驱动。</p>\n<p>撤回的执行顺序是先停新增再下架已有：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>把分发记录置为 <code>withdrawn</code>（本地状态先落地，避免新的投放计划引用它）。</li>\n<li>调用渠道接口下架，记录结果。</li>\n<li>对渠道接口失败或没有下架接口的情况，记录为待人工处理并告警。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>第三步是必须保留的：不是所有渠道都提供素材下架接口，视频类尤其常见只能停止投放而不能删除素材。这种情况下&quot;撤回&quot;的实际语义是&quot;停止使用&quot;，而已经分发出去的副本仍在渠道侧——这一点必须如实记录，不能因为本地状态是 <code>withdrawn</code> 就宣称已经删除。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE distribution&#10;   SET status = &#39;withdrawn&#39;, withdrawn_at = now()&#10; WHERE version_id = :version_id&#10;   AND status IN (&#39;uploaded&#39;,&#39;in_review&#39;,&#39;live&#39;)&#10;RETURNING distribution_id, channel, external_ref;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> distribution</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'withdrawn'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, withdrawn_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> version_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :version_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'uploaded'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'in_review'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'live'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RETURNING distribution_id, channel, external_ref;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>返回的列表交给渠道适配器逐个执行下架，每个结果单独落一条日志。用一条 UPDATE 加逐条执行的方式，而不是先查后改，是为了让&quot;哪些记录被撤回&quot;与状态变更是原子的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"授权撤销的批量撤回\">授权撤销的批量撤回</h3><p>授权被撤销时，受影响的不止一个版本——<a href=\"../creative-dam-model/asset-version-rights-license\">版本/版权/授权有效期管理</a> 里提到撤销可能一次覆盖上千个资产。撤回必须以资产集合为单位执行，并且要有速率控制：同时向同一渠道发起上千次下架请求会触发限流，导致部分请求失败而部分成功，留下一个不一致的中间态。</p>\n<p>可行的做法是按渠道分批，批内并发、批间串行，每批完成后记录进度，失败批次可单独重跑。进度本身就是可以持久化的状态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE withdrawal_batch (&#10;  batch_id     bigserial PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  trigger_kind text NOT NULL CHECK (trigger_kind IN&#10;                 (&#39;version_superseded&#39;,&#39;rights_revoked&#39;,&#39;rights_expired&#39;,&#10;                  &#39;approval_invalidated&#39;,&#39;campaign_ended&#39;)),&#10;  trigger_ref  text NOT NULL,&#10;  channel      text NOT NULL,&#10;  total_count  int  NOT NULL,&#10;  done_count   int  NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  failed_count int  NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  status       text NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;running&#39;&#10;                 CHECK (status IN (&#39;running&#39;,&#39;completed&#39;,&#39;partial_failed&#39;)),&#10;  started_at   timestamptz NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  finished_at  timestamptz&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> withdrawal_batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  batch_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigserial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  trigger_kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (trigger_kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                 (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'version_superseded'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rights_revoked'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rights_expired'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                  'approval_invalidated'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'campaign_ended'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  trigger_ref  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  total_count  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  done_count   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  failed_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'running'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                 CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'running'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'completed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'partial_failed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  started_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  finished_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>partial_failed</code> 是必须保留的终态。一个批次里部分成功部分失败时，不能简单重跑整个批次——已成功的记录重跑会产生无意义的错误。重跑只针对失败集，因此失败集需要能被查询出来（在分发记录上加一个 <code>withdrawal_batch_id</code> 与 <code>withdrawal_error</code> 即可）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分发与效果数据的接口\">分发与效果数据的接口</h2><p>分发记录是效果回流的外键锚点。渠道返回的效果数据（曝光、点击、消耗）以渠道的素材标识为索引，回到本地必须经过 <code>external_ref → distribution_id → version_id</code> 的映射。这条映射链的质量直接决定第 4 章归因的可行性：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>映射缺失（渠道数据有 <code>external_ref</code> 但本地无记录）说明存在绕过分发系统的投放，这类数据无法归因，应当单独统计其占比。</li>\n<li>映射多对一（多个 <code>distribution_id</code> 指向同一 <code>external_ref</code>）说明同一素材在多个活动中复用了同一渠道对象，效果数据无法拆分到活动粒度。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这两种情况都应在分发写入时就通过唯一约束尽量避免。第 4 章的 <a href=\"../creative-performance-loop/creative-performance-attribution\">素材效果与转化归因</a> 会详细处理映射不完整时的补救策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分发单位是（版本，市场，渠道位置，投放计划），<code>external_id</code> 管幂等、<code>external_ref</code> 管撤回与效果拉取，两者都不可省。</li>\n<li>规格适配是最后一次渲染机会，渠道的字段条数下限（如标题至少 3 条）必须在本地校验，不能等渠道报错。</li>\n<li>双宽字符语言的字符计数策略必须落到配置里，否则文案校验会系统性失真。</li>\n<li>规格矩阵与市场渲染规则同构，带生效期，可回溯历史。</li>\n<li>上传重试前必须对账，超时不等于没发生。</li>\n<li>渠道审核异步，状态机要把上传成功与可投放分开，拒绝理由映射到本地缺陷分类形成闭环。</li>\n<li>撤回先停新增再下架，渠道无下架接口的情况要如实记录为&quot;停止使用&quot;而非&quot;已删除&quot;。</li>\n<li>授权撤销触发批量撤回，必须分批限速，<code>partial_failed</code> 是必须保留的终态。</li>\n<li>分发记录是效果回流的外键锚点，映射缺口要在写入时用约束尽量消除；归因详见 <a href=\"../creative-performance-loop/creative-performance-attribution\">素材效果与转化归因</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"审批后多渠道分发","id":"审批后多渠道分发"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：分发记录与投放绑定","id":"核心概念-分发记录与投放绑定"},{"level":2,"text":"规格适配：最后一次渲染机会","id":"规格适配-最后一次渲染机会"},{"level":3,"text":"规格矩阵的维护","id":"规格矩阵的维护"},{"level":3,"text":"三类要求的校验顺序","id":"三类要求的校验顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等上传与重试","id":"幂等上传与重试"},{"level":3,"text":"渠道审核的异步性","id":"渠道审核的异步性"},{"level":2,"text":"撤回：比推送更难的一半","id":"撤回-比推送更难的一半"},{"level":3,"text":"授权撤销的批量撤回","id":"授权撤销的批量撤回"},{"level":2,"text":"分发与效果数据的接口","id":"分发与效果数据的接口"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"广告宣称/品牌合规校验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-creative-dam-aigc-production/creative-approval-flow/ad-claim-brand-compliance"},"next":{"title":"素材效果与转化归因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketing-creative-dam-aigc-production/creative-performance-loop/creative-performance-attribution"}}